module gunbc.cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_scaffold

import std.disposition { Disposition, Scaffold, SingleAuthority }
import std.decl_ref { DeclarationRef, WholeDeclaration }
import std.types { String, Int }

data cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_scaffold_note: String = "THE REALIZATION IS SCAFFOLD EVEN THOUGH THE POLICY ABOVE IT IS MODELED, and that distinction is the whole reason this row exists (operator ruling on gunbc#7804, 2026-08-04). gunbc.witness_deferral_freeze and v2.workflow.witness_admission are the authority: the frozen population, the two standing axes and both gates are .dag facts. What lands in cli_run.rs is one REALIZATION of them — a text scan over three .dag authorities, a git baseline reader, and the enforcement path the floor calls — and the .dag side being correct does not exempt it. cli_run.rs is the largest hand-maintained Rust wall in the program and it is already growing against its own hollowing plan, so several hundred more lines may not enter unaccounted merely because the policy above them is modeled well.

MEASURED AT LANDING, so the accounting is a fact rather than an impression: 487 added production lines and 371 added test lines. The production half is three things and no more — the FrozenPathDeferral and CommitWitnessClaim source scans, the git-baseline monotonicity reader, and the classification plus refusal path the floor invokes.

WHY IT IS HAND-RUST TODAY rather than a modeling failure: the floor's admission step runs before any .dag evaluation is available to it, over a population the host itself discovered by walking the source roots, so the check has to execute where the walk is. That is the same constraint the sibling scan already carries (cli_run_witness_admission_source_scan_scaffold), and this block deliberately reuses its shape and its parsing helpers rather than inventing a second idiom — one scaffold with two subjects is cheaper to delete than two scaffolds.

FAIL-CLOSED IN BOTH DIRECTIONS, which is what makes an interim scan tolerable: an unparseable row head PANICS with its location rather than yielding no key, because a silently dropped freeze row would refuse a legitimately frozen witness; and a consumer expressed in an unrecognized form yields no key, so its row surfaces as a loud refusal rather than being absorbed."

data cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_scaffold: Disposition = Scaffold {
  dissolves_to: SingleAuthority,
  bind: DeclarationRef {
    module_path: "v1_compiler.cli_run",
    decl_name: "frozen_path_deferral_keys",
    field: WholeDeclaration
  }
}

data cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_dissolve_trigger: String = "DISSOLVE-ON, in the order the operator specified and with each step's own condition, so this is a sequence rather than an aspiration. STEP 1 — seed realization, which is what landed: frozen_path_deferral_keys, commit_roster_witness_claim_keys, classify_deferred_discovery_rows and collect_frozen_path_deferral_additions_against read the .dag authorities by text scan. STEP 2 — the frozen-deferral projection is emitted or natively realized from gunbc.witness_deferral_freeze rather than scanned, on the same route the witness-realization lane is already building for the other rosters; the parsing helpers (frozen_path_deferral_keys_from_source, commit_roster_witness_claim_keys_from_source, quoted_after_field, bracket_list_after_field, quoted_literals) delete at that point. STEP 3 — the classification and refusal path follows the projection, at which point the whole block including the git baseline reader deletes and the floor consumes the .dag gates directly. THE STRICTER CONDITION, and it dissolves this row entirely rather than shrinking it: the frozen population reaching zero removes the freeze, the path-policy pass-through arm and every line of this block together, because with no legacy debt there is nothing for the ratchet to tolerate. Whichever fires first, nothing here is permanent surface."

data cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_production_loc_delta: Int = 487

data cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_test_loc_delta: Int = 371

data cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_loc_delta_basis: String = "Measured against origin/main at landing by partitioning the diff hunks at the production/test boundary of cli_run.rs. These two numbers are a DATED LANDING MEASUREMENT and are deliberately not asserted by any witness: a live count would be a change detector over a file every lane edits, and the roster-registry ruling on stored counts applies to Rust lines exactly as it applies to roster rows. They exist so the growth this scaffold accounts for is a stated quantity rather than an impression, and so the deletion at dissolution has a size to be checked against."

data cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_authority_anchor: String = "gunbc.witness_deferral_freeze witness_deferral_freeze_authority_note"
